# THE HUSH WRAP (GEAR.md §6, G8): a warm wrap lined with hush slate at the hem
# and soles; the steps are heard as on moss, on any land (StealthNoise). What
# it does is heard, not seen, so tests/gear/test_hush_wrap.gd measures it; this
# is what it looks like worn.
#   tools/tour.sh tours/hush_wrap.tour --seed=1 --hour=11 --weather=clear:0 --fit=wrap_hush
coast calm
place spawn
wait 1.0
shot 01-the-wrap-worn with worn:wrap_hush
